  "title": "New Bags | LOEWE to Launch the 2027 Pre-Spring Flamenco Flap Bag: A Flap Silhouette with a Metal Knot Closure",
  "original_title": "新包 | LOEWE 即将发售2027早春新款 Flamenco Flap 手袋：翻盖廓形，金属绳结扣",
  "excerpt": "LOEWE will release the Flamenco Flap handbag in its 2027 pre-spring collection on November 12, featuring a new flap silhouette and interlocking metal knot detail.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-11-09",
  "date_label": "November 09, 2026",
