    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "LOEWE is set to release its 2027 pre-spring collection on November 12, and this season brings a new handbag design — the Flamenco Flap. Reimagining the classic Flamenco with a fresh flap silhouette, the signature knot detail evolves into an interlocking metal ornament, while supple leather and gathered pleats lend an effortlessly elegant character.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
