          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/34033ed33020cae2.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/cad15c9231b4d150.jpg",
          "price": ""
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/5210a928adf12cd0.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/dd93e9eee29ebf9a.jpg",
          "price": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Flamenco bag debuted in the 1970s, inspired by traditional Spanish flamenco dance. Crafted from soft nappa leather, it takes on a relaxed, gathered silhouette reminiscent of a dancer's flowing skirt, fastened with a drawstring closure and finished with twisted knot ornaments at either side.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "text": null,
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/ecace402e3416d9a.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/ecace402e3416d9a.jpg",
          "price": "弗拉门戈舞"
        },
        {
          "url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/20474cd7f04b176a.jpg",
          "full_url": "https://cdn.kynbag.com/images/j788smw/20474cd7f04b176a.jpg",
          "price": "Flamenco 手袋"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The most immediate change in the new Flamenco Flap is the reworking of the drawstring closure into a flap design, giving the bag a cleaner, more defined outline and a touch of polished refinement. The body is still made from soft nappa leather, retaining its plush, delicate feel and naturally pleated shape — a deft balance between formal and relaxed. The signature knot now features an elegant metal clasp that can be secured to the front of the bag with a sliding fastening, echoing the gold-stamped logo, or left to hang naturally at the sides for a playful accent.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
