    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The bag comes with two interchangeable straps — one long, one short. The tubular handle measures 30cm, while the adjustable strap ranges from 70cm to 116cm, allowing for hand-carry, shoulder, and crossbody styling. The interior is lined in herringbone cotton canvas, with an embossed LOEWE leather patch on the back. The small size is offered in four colorways: classic black with gold hardware, flamenco red in a nod to the bag's origins, an ethereal white paired with silver hardware, and a bronze tone with a distinctly autumnal feel.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
